@startuml OctoTify_Sequence_GetChannelTypes

skinparam sequenceStyle svg
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 150

title 获取渠道类型元数据 (GET /api/channel-types)

actor "用户" as User
participant "前端" as Frontend
participant "HTTPServer" as Server
participant "JWTAuth\n中间件" as JWT
participant "ChannelHandler" as Handler
participant "ChannelService" as Service

User -> Frontend: 打开创建渠道页面
activate Frontend
Frontend -> Server: GET /api/channel-types
note right
  Header:
  - Authorization: Bearer {accessToken}
  - X-Request-ID: {request_id}
end note
activate Server

== JWT 认证中间件拦截 ==

Server -> JWT: JWTAuth(accessToken)
activate JWT

alt 未提供认证令牌
  JWT --> Server: 401 {code: 100001}
  deactivate JWT
  Server --> Frontend: 401 {code: 100001, msg: "未提供认证令牌"}
  Frontend --> User: 跳转登录页
else 令牌无效或已过期
  JWT --> Server: 401 {code: 100001}
  deactivate JWT
  Server --> Frontend: 401 {code: 100001, msg: "认证令牌无效或已过期"}
  Frontend --> Frontend: 使用 Refresh Token 刷新 (POST /api/auth/refresh)
else 令牌有效
  JWT --> Server: userId (从 claims 中提取)
  deactivate JWT
  Server -> Handler: GetChannelTypes()
  activate Handler

  Handler -> Service: GetChannelTypes()
  activate Service

  Service -> Service: 遍历 ChannelTypeMetas
  note over Service
    从预定义的 ChannelTypeMetas 数组获取
    每个渠道类型包含:
    - type: 渠道类型标识
    - name: 渠道类型名称
    - description: 描述
    - config_fields: 配置字段定义
  end note

  Service --> Handler: []ChannelTypeMeta
  deactivate Service
  Handler --> Server: {code: 0, data: [...]}
  deactivate Handler
  Server --> Frontend: {code: 0, data: [...]}
  deactivate Server

  Frontend -> Frontend: 根据 config_fields 动态渲染表单
  note over Frontend
    根据字段类型渲染不同组件:
    - string → 输入框
    - number → 数字输入框
    - password → 密码输入框
    - url → URL输入框
  end note

  Frontend --> User: 展示渠道类型选择和配置表单
  deactivate Frontend
end

@enduml
